[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-shell-daystar-women-in-power-training-wipt-program-2026-for-nigerians-career-opportunity-297":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},297,"shell-daystar-women-in-power-training-wipt-program-2026-for-nigerians-career-opportunity-297","Shell Daystar Women In Power Training (wipt) Program 2026 For Nigerians: Career Opportunity","\u003Cp>Applications are now open for the Women in Power Training (WIPT) Program 2026.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Shell, in partnership with Daystar Power Energy Solutions, is inviting applications for the 2026 WIPT 2026 Program from young Nigerians.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Get Realtime Updates from \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fnews.google.com\u002Fsearch?q=site%3Ascholarsworld.ng%20when%3A7d&amp;hl=en-NG&amp;gl=NG&amp;ceid=NG%3Aen\">Scholars World on Google\u003C\u002Fa> News (\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fnews.google.com\u002Fsearch?q=site%3Ascholarsworld.ng%20when%3A7d&amp;hl=en-NG&amp;gl=NG&amp;ceid=NG%3Aen\">Follow us\u003C\u002Fa>)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Shell Daystar Women in Power Training (WIPT) offers a competitive stipend, hands-on training and experience, professional development, and career growth for young graduates seeking to turn their degrees into careers in energy.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Shell Daystar Women in Power Training Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Shell | Daystar Energy\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Sponsorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands-on Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly Stipend\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Professional Development\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Career Growth\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Expert Mentorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: July 15, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Shell Daystar Women in Power Training (WIPT) Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The 2026 Daystar Power Group Women in Power Training is a one-year program that offers hands-on experience, expert mentorship, and the opportunity to grow into a future leader in the solar industry.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Since launching the WIPT in 2019, Daustar Power has run the program through five cohorts, training female electrical engineering graduates to move from theory into live solar installation work.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The program exists because an engineering degree, on its own, doesn’t teach someone how to commission a site or manage a project under pressure. WIPT is built to close that gap.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Shell Women in Power Training (WIPT) Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Women in Power Training Program 2026 offers the following benefits;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands-on training and real-world experience in solar engineering.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship from industry experts.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Opportunities for professional development and career growth.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A supportive and inclusive work environment.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Competitive stipend and potential for full-time employment upon program completion.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Trainees who perform well are typically considered for full-time roles at Daystar Power.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>WIPT 2026 Program Schedule\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The program runs on six pillars:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Advanced solar engineering training, beyond classroom theory\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands-on project experience on live sites and installations\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Industry-ready skills and safety protocols used globally\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Direct mentorship from experienced Daystar engineers\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Leadership training in managing teams and projects\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A professional network of peers and industry experts\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Shell Daystar WIPT 2026 Program Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Shell Daystar WIPT 2026 Program, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fshell-daystar-women-in-power-training-wipt\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>Education\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa>: a Bachelor’s Degree in Electrical Engineering from a reputable University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Completion of NYSC\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Experience: 0 – 2 years of experience\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Strong interest in solar energy and sustainability.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Excellent problem-solving skills and attention to detail.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Ability to work effectively in a team environment.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Strong communication and interpersonal skills.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Character:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Self-motivated female engineer with a learner’s mindset.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Passion for renewable energy.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How To Apply for \u003Cstrong>Shell Daystar Women in Power Training\u003C\u002Fstrong> (WIPT) Program 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Shell Daystar Women in Power Training Program 2026, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click the green button below to go to the program webpage.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>On the page, click \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fdaystar-power.com\u002Fen\u002Fwipt\">\u003Cstrong>APPLY\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa> and complete the application form.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Begin your application by clicking on the button below.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Deadline: July 15th, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.daystar-power.com\u002Fen\u002Fnews-article?post_id=173018\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.daystar-power.com\u002Fen\u002Fnews-article?post_id=173018\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-06-19 13:57:25",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fshell-daystar-women-in-power-training-wipt-program-2026-for-nigerians-career-opportunity\u002F6a353cb5d749c9.82590804_screenshot 2026-06-19 132844.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fshell-daystar-women-in-power-training-wipt-program-2026-for-nigerians-career-opportunity\u002F6a353cb5d749c9.82590804_screenshot%202026-06-19%20132844.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,39,49,58,67,75,84,93,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"dat